"The tab beside it comes forward, and the disc shows a cross while that is what letting go would do. A pin keeps its page, and a small window closes as it always has." = "旁边的标签随即来到前面；此时圆盘显示叉号，表示松手就会关闭。固定标签保留自己的页面，小窗口仍与以往一样关闭";
"Two fingers on it send it to the corner or edge they point at, instead of pushing it along; a strong swipe at the side of the screen it is against tucks it in there, a sliver left to bring it back by. Dragging still puts it anywhere" = "在上面用两根手指轻扫，会把它甩向所指的角落或边缘，而不是推着走；在它贴着的那一侧用力轻扫会把它收进去，只留一条细边，便于再拉出来。拖动仍然可以把它放在任意位置";
"Off, videos start by themselves, sound and all, as with Safari's Allow All Auto-Play; a site's card can quiet that one site. On, nothing starts by itself, even without sound, and a video plays when you press play. Tabs already open follow from their next page, or once reloaded" = "关闭时，视频会自行开始并带声音，如同 Safari 的「允许所有自动播放」；站点卡片里可以单独让某个站点静音开播。开启后，任何视频都不会自行开始，即使没有声音，按下播放才开始。已打开的标签页从下一个页面或重新载入后生效";
"Float the video when you switch tabs" = "切换标签页时浮动视频";
"A video playing on YouTube and the like comes out into its floating window when you go to another tab, and back when you return. ⇧⌘P still floats one by hand" = "在 YouTube 等网站播放的视频，切到其他标签页时会进入浮动窗口，回来时又回到标签页。⇧⌘P 仍可手动浮动";
"Float the video when you switch apps" = "切换 App 时浮动视频";
"A video playing on the site you're on comes out into its floating window as another app comes to the front, and goes back into its tab when you return" = "当前网站正在播放的视频，在其他 App 来到前台时会进入浮动窗口，回到 Aura 时又回到标签页";
"A local socket for testing. Its tabs open beside yours with a flask on them and never take over — see ./bench" = "用于测试的本地套接字。它打开的标签页与你的并列，带有烧瓶标记，永不抢占当前页面——见 ./bench";
"Back, forward and reload on the left" = "后退、前进和重新载入放在左侧";
