"Counted from when you last left the tab, while Aura is quit too. Pin a tab, name it or put it in a group to keep it; private tabs, sound, calls and anything typed stay. ⇧⌘T and History bring one back." = "从你最后一次离开该标签页算起，Aura 退出期间也计时。固定、命名或归入分组的标签页会保留；无痕浏览、播放声音、通话中以及有输入内容的标签页不会关闭。⇧⌘T 和历史记录可以找回。";
"Adds Keep This Site Awake to the site card. Chosen sites use more memory: they neither sleep nor close automatically, even under memory pressure. Private choices last only in that tab." = "在网站卡片中加入「保持此网站唤醒」。选中的网站会占用更多内存：即使内存紧张，也不会休眠或自动关闭。无痕浏览中的选择仅在该标签页有效。";
"Load background tabs when you go to them" = "前往后台标签页时才载入";
"A link opened behind the page, with ⌘-click or the middle button, or a batch of links from another app, waits until you go to its tab. ⇧⌘-click still takes you there at once." = "在页面后台打开的链接（⌘-点击或中键），或来自其他 App 的一批链接，会在你前往其标签页时才载入。⇧⌘-点击仍会立即前往。";
"Leave a new tab when the last tab closes" = "关闭最后一个标签页时留下新标签页";
"Close the last tab that isn't pinned and a new tab takes its place, ready for an address. Otherwise you land on a pinned tab." = "关闭最后一个非固定标签页后，原位会出现一个等待输入地址的新标签页。否则会跳到某个固定标签页。";
"After current puts a link beside the tab you're on, and ⌘T's new tab at the end. Pins stay first; a link from a group stays in it." = "「当前之后」会把链接放在当前标签页旁边，⌘T 的新标签页放在末尾。固定标签页始终在最前；分组中的链接留在该分组内。";
"After current" = "当前之后";
"Type the start of a site's name, like red or yout, then Tab, and what you type next searches that site. Sites you visit that offer a search join the list." = "输入网站名的开头（如 red 或 yout），按 Tab，接下来输入的内容就在该网站内搜索。你访问过且支持搜索的网站会自动加入列表。";
"Each time Aura opens, your pinned tabs, tab groups and named tabs are there and last time's other tabs aren't." = "每次打开 Aura 时，固定标签页、标签页组和命名过的标签页都在，上次的其他标签页不在。";
"Separate sets of tabs, signed in where the others are or starting afresh, switched with ⌃1–⌃9, two fingers sideways over the column, or the space's icon. Mission Control's own ⌃1–⌃9, if you turned them on, take those keys first." = "相互独立的标签页集合，可沿用其他空间的登录状态或全新开始；用 ⌃1–⌃9、在侧边栏上双指横扫，或点击空间图标切换。若已开启调度中心的 ⌃1–⌃9，它们会优先占用这些快捷键。";
"Keep a pin in every space: right-click it and choose Keep in Every Space. Each space signs in to it the way that space does." = "让一个固定标签页出现在所有空间：右键点击它并选择「保留在每个空间」。各空间按自己的方式登录该网站。";
"Named sections in the sidebar. Right-click a tab to start a group; click its heading to hide or show its tabs." = "侧边栏中有名字的分段。右键点击标签页即可新建分组；点击分组标题可隐藏或显示其标签页。";
"As in Arc: pins as squares for the sites you live in, pins as rows under them for pages you keep, and a line over the rest with Clear. Right-click a tab to pin it as a row." = "如同 Arc：常用网站固定为方格，常留页面固定为方格下方的行，其上方有一条分隔线和「清除」。右键点击标签页可将其固定为一行。";
"Pins go back home" = "固定标签页回到原页";
"As in Arc: a pinned tab closed with ⌘W, or left open when Aura quits, comes back at the page it was pinned at rather than wherever you went from there." = "如同 Arc：用 ⌘W 关闭的固定标签页，或 Aura 退出时仍开着的固定标签页，会回到当初固定的那个页面，而不是你之后去过的位置。";
"Pins stay on their site" = "固定标签页留在原网站";
