/* —— 0.10 这一版的说明 —— */
"Help › Send Feedback opens an issue with the version already in it." = "「帮助 › 发送反馈」会打开一个已经写进版本的 issue。";

/* —— 0.1.0 的说明（2026-10-25 定稿：讲 Aura 本身，起因是 Arc 停运）—— */
"Tabs in a row across the top, or down a side as a column; spaces for the different parts of your life; pinned tabs that keep their place, as squares or as rows with their names." = "标签页可以横在窗口顶部，也可以成为侧边一列；给生活不同部分各自的空间；固定标签页留在原处——方块，或带名字的行。";
"It runs on the WebKit already inside every Mac: it opens at once, weighs about 7 MB, and keeps no second copy of anything in memory." = "它跑在每台 Mac 自带的 WebKit 上：打开即用，体积约 7 MB，不在内存里多留任何一份副本。";
"Reading mode, a floating video, profiles with their own sign-ins and history, pages translated on this Mac, and passwords in your keychain." = "阅读模式、浮动视频、各有独立登录状态和历史记录的配置文件、在这台 Mac 上翻译的页面，以及存在你钥匙串里的密码。";

/* —— 0.1.0 的说明（更新说明口吻）—— */
"The first version, made for the day Arc stops." = "第一个版本，为 Arc 停运之后的那些日子而做。";
"One field for addresses and searches, and the page takes the rest of the window. Settings, history, downloads and a new tab are commands you can type there." = "地址与搜索只有一处输入框，其余交给页面。设置、历史记录、下载和新标签页都是能在这里直接输入的命令。";
"Every sentence in English and in 简体中文, by the Mac's own language, with the English kept as the key — a sentence no translation has reached yet shows in English rather than as a blank." = "每一句话都有英文与简体中文两版，跟着 Mac 自己的语言走；英文原文作为键保留，还没译到的句子显示英文，而不是空白。";
"Chrome extensions from the Chrome Web Store on macOS 15.4 or later, with bookmarks, history, downloads, side panels and offscreen documents filled in where WebKit leaves them out." = "macOS 15.4 及以上可以从 Chrome 应用商店安装扩展，WebKit 缺的书签、历史记录、下载、侧边面板与离屏文档都由 Aura 自己补上。";
"Ads and trackers refused before a request is made, and their empty boxes hidden before the first frame — EasyList's, EasyPrivacy's and uBlock Origin's own lists, with the checks sites make for a blocker answered as they want to hear it." = "广告和跟踪器在请求发出之前就被拒绝，它们留下的空格在第一帧之前就藏起来——用的是 EasyList、EasyPrivacy 和 uBlock Origin 自己的列表；网站对拦截器的探测也会得到它想听到的答案。";
"No account, no sync, no telemetry: tabs, history and passwords stay on this Mac, and the only things that leave it are the pages you ask for and one request a day to see whether there is a newer version." = "没有账号、没有同步、没有遥测：标签页、历史记录和密码都留在这台 Mac 上，离开它的只有你要的那些页面，以及每天一次看看有没有新版本的请求。";
"Passkeys are not in this version: the entitlement they need is granted to organization accounts only." = "这一版没有通行密钥：它需要的那条权利只发给组织类型的开发者账号。";
"Reading mode, a floating video, profiles with their own sign-ins and history, pages translated on this Mac, and passwords in the keychain." = "阅读模式、浮动视频、各有独立登录状态与历史记录的配置文件、在这台 Mac 上翻译的页面，以及存在钥匙串里的密码。";
